<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Happy 30th, Marilyn 🌸</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;0,700;1,400;1,600&family=Nunito:wght@300;400;600;700;800;900&family=Dancing+Script:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
*,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
:root{
  --cream:#FDF6F0;--ivory:#FEFAF6;--rose:#E8C4B8;--blush:#F7E8E2;
  --mauve:#7D4E57;--deep:#5C3640;--gold:#C9A96E;--gold-light:#F0DDB8;
  --pink:#F2A7B8;--text:#3D2B2B;--text-light:#9A7070;
}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
body{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;background:var(--ivory);color:var(--text);overflow-x:hidden;}

#confetti-canvas{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none;z-index:9999;}

/* COVER */
#cover{
  min-height:100vh;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FEF0F5 0%,#FADADD 30%,#F5C6D0 60%,#E8B4C0 100%);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  text-align:center;padding:2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.cover-bg-circle{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;opacity:0.12;background:radial-gradient(circle,var(--gold),transparent);}
.c1{width:600px;height:600px;top:-200px;right:-200px;}
.c2{width:400px;height:400px;bottom:-100px;left:-100px;}
.floating-el{position:absolute;pointer-events:none;animation:floaty 5s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes floaty{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0deg);}50%{transform:translateY(-18px) rotate(10deg);}}
.cover-tag{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--mauve);margin-bottom:0.5rem;animation:fadeDown 0.8s ease both;opacity:0.9;}
.cover-thirty-bg{
  position:absolute;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
  font-size:clamp(16rem,45vw,28rem);font-weight:700;
  color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:3px rgba(201,169,110,0.15);
  top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-52%);
  pointer-events:none;line-height:1;user-select:none;
  animation:fadeIn 1s ease 0.2s both;
}
.cover-name{
  font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
  font-size:clamp(3.5rem,12vw,7rem);font-weight:700;
  color:var(--deep);line-height:1;position:relative;z-index:2;
  animation:popIn 0.9s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 0.3s both;
  text-shadow:0 4px 30px rgba(92,54,64,0.15);
}
.cover-thirty-badge{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  width:80px;height:80px;border-radius:50%;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#E8C870);
  color:white;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;
  font-size:2rem;font-weight:700;margin:1.2rem auto;
  box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(201,169,110,0.4);
  animation:bounceIn 1s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 0.6s both;
  position:relative;z-index:2;
}
.cover-sub{
  font-size:clamp(0.9rem,2.5vw,1.1rem);color:var(--mauve);
  margin-top:0.3rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.05em;
  position:relative;z-index:2;animation:fadeUp 1s ease 0.8s both;
}
.cover-btn{
  margin-top:2rem;position:relative;z-index:2;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--deep),var(--mauve));
  color:white;border:none;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
  font-weight:900;font-size:1.05rem;padding:1rem 2.8rem;
  border-radius:50px;cursor:pointer;
  box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(92,54,64,0.3);
  transition:transform 0.2s,box-shadow 0.2s;
  animation:bounceIn 1s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1) 1s both;
  letter-spacing:0.03em;
}
.cover-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.03);box-shadow:0 14px 40px rgba(92,54,64,0.4);}
.cover-btn:active{transform:scale(0.97);}
.scroll-nudge{
  position:absolute;bottom:2rem;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);
  font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--mauve);opacity:0;transition:opacity 1s;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.4rem;z-index:2;
}
.scroll-nudge.show{opacity:0.55;}
.arrow-bounce{animation:ab 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes ab{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0);}50%{transform:translateY(6px);}}
@keyframes fadeDown{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-20px);}to{opacity:0.9;transform:translateY(0);}}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}
@keyframes fadeIn{from{opacity:0;}to{opacity:1;}}
@keyframes popIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(0.6);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}
@keyframes bounceIn{from{opacity:0;transform:scale(0.3);}60%{transform:scale(1.08);}to{opacity:1;transform:scale(1);}}

/* SECTIONS */
.sw{opacity:0;transform:translateY(50px);transition:opacity 0.9s ease,transform 0.9s ease;}
.sw.visible{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
.sec-inner{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:5rem 1.5rem;}

.eyebrow{display:block;font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:0.4rem;font-weight:600;}
.sec-title{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,5.5vw,3rem);font-weight:700;color:var(--deep);line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:1.8rem;}
.sec-title em{font-style:italic;color:var(--mauve);}

/* LETTER */
.letter-wrap{
  background:white;border-radius:28px;padding:2.8rem 2.5rem;
  box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(232,196,184,0.3);
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.letter-wrap::before{
  content:'';position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:5px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--rose),var(--gold),var(--pink));
}
.letter-body{font-size:1.03rem;line-height:2;color:var(--text);font-weight:400;}
.letter-body p+p{margin-top:1.3em;}
.letter-sign{margin-top:2rem;font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--mauve);}

/* 30 THINGS */
#things-sec{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FEF0F5,#FDE8EE,#F9E4ED);padding:5rem 1.5rem;}
.things-intro{font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-light);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:2.5rem;font-weight:400;}
.things-masonry{columns:2;column-gap:1rem;}
@media(min-width:600px){.things-masonry{columns:3;}}
.thing-pill{
  break-inside:avoid;margin-bottom:1rem;display:block;
  background:white;border-radius:20px;padding:1rem 1.2rem;
  box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(232,196,184,0.25);
  transition:transform 0.25s,box-shadow 0.25s;
  border-top:3px solid var(--rose);
}
.thing-pill:nth-child(3n){border-top-color:var(--gold);}
.thing-pill:nth-child(3n+2){border-top-color:var(--pink);}
.thing-pill:hover{transform:translateY(-5px) rotate(-1deg);box-shadow:0 12px 35px rgba(232,196,184,0.4);}
.thing-pill-num{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:1.6rem;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;display:block;margin-bottom:0.2rem;}
.thing-pill-text{font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--text);font-weight:600;}

/* CHECKLIST */
#check-sec{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#3D1F2D,#5C3640,#7D4E57);padding:5rem 1.5rem;}
#check-sec .eyebrow{color:var(--gold-light);}
#check-sec .sec-title{color:white;}
.check-intro{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);font-size:0.97rem;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;}
.prog-bg{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);border-radius:50px;height:10px;overflow:hidden;}
.prog-fill{height:100%;border-radius:50px;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--pink),var(--gold));transition:width 0.6s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.prog-label{font-size:0.82rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);margin-top:0.5rem;margin-bottom:1.8rem;}
.check-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.9rem;}
.check-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07);border-radius:16px;
  padding:1.1rem 1.3rem;cursor:pointer;
  border:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  transition:background 0.2s,transform 0.15s;user-select:none;
}
.check-item:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,0.13);transform:translateX(5px);}
.check-item.done{background:rgba(201,169,110,0.15);border-color:rgba(201,169,110,0.3);}
.check-item.done .check-label{color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);text-decoration:line-through;}
.check-box{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:8px;flex-shrink:0;border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.25);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:0.9rem;transition:all 0.2s;}
.check-item.done .check-box{background:var(--gold);border-color:var(--gold);color:white;}
.check-emoji{font-size:1.2rem;flex-shrink:0;}
.check-label{font-size:0.95rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);line-height:1.4;font-weight:600;}

/* RATE HER */
#rate-sec{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FEF0F5,#FDE8EE);padding:5rem 1.5rem;}
.rate-intro{font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:2rem;line-height:1.7;}
.rate-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.2rem;}
.rate-card{background:white;border-radius:20px;padding:1.5rem 1.8rem;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(232,196,184,0.2);transition:transform 0.2s;}
.rate-card:hover{transform:translateX(5px);}
.rate-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0.8rem;}
.rate-cat{font-weight:800;font-size:0.97rem;color:var(--deep);}
.rate-num{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--gold);line-height:1;}
.rate-bar-bg{background:var(--blush);border-radius:50px;height:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:0.7rem;}
.rate-bar{height:100%;border-radius:50px;width:0%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--rose),var(--gold));transition:width 1.3s cubic-bezier(.34,1.56,.64,1);}
.rate-verdict{font-size:0.83rem;color:var(--text-light);font-style:italic;}

/* PRAYER */
#prayer-sec{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#2A1020,#3D1F2D,#5C3640);padding:5rem 1.5rem;}
#prayer-sec .eyebrow{color:var(--gold-light);}
#prayer-sec .sec-title{color:white;}
.prayer-body{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.2rem);line-height:2.2;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);}
.prayer-body p+p{margin-top:1.3em;}
.prayer-amen{margin-top:2.5rem;font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-size:0.85rem;}

/* SPOTIFY */
#spotify-sec{background:var(--ivory);padding:5rem 1.5rem;}
.spotify-card{
  background:white;border-radius:28px;padding:2.8rem 2rem;
  text-align:center;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(232,196,184,0.25);
  position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.spotify-card::after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;right:0;height:4px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1DB954,var(--gold),#1DB954);}
.spotify-pulse{font-size:4rem;display:block;margin-bottom:1rem;animation:pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes pulse{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}50%{transform:scale(1.1);}}
.spotify-name{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.5rem;color:var(--deep);margin-bottom:0.3rem;}
.spotify-sub{font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-light);margin-bottom:2rem;}
.spotify-btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:0.6rem;
  background:#1DB954;color:white;font-weight:900;
  font-size:0.95rem;text-decoration:none;
  padding:1rem 2.5rem;border-radius:50px;
  box-shadow:0 6px 25px rgba(29,185,84,0.35);
  transition:transform 0.2s,box-shadow 0.2s;
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
}
.spotify-btn:hover{transform:scale(1.05);box-shadow:0 10px 35px rgba(29,185,84,0.45);}

/* CLOSING */
#closing-sec{
  text-align:center;
  background:linear-gradient(160deg,#FEF0F5,#FADADD,#F5C6D0,#E8B4C0);
  padding:8rem 2rem 7rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
}
.closing-bg{
  position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);
  font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:clamp(15rem,50vw,30rem);font-weight:700;
  color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:2px rgba(92,54,64,0.07);
  pointer-events:none;line-height:1;user-select:none;
}
.closing-hearts{font-size:2rem;display:block;margin-bottom:1.5rem;animation:hb 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;}
@keyframes hb{0%,100%{transform:scale(1);}50%{transform:scale(1.2);}}
.closing-quote{
  font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;
  font-size:clamp(1.3rem,4vw,2rem);color:var(--deep);
  line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:1.5rem;position:relative;z-index:1;
  max-width:600px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;
}
.closing-sig{font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive;font-size:1.8rem;color:var(--mauve);position:relative;z-index:1;}
.closing-replay{
  margin-top:2rem;background:transparent;border:2px solid var(--mauve);
  color:var(--mauve);font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;
  font-size:0.9rem;padding:0.8rem 2rem;border-radius:50px;
  cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;position:relative;z-index:1;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;
}
.closing-replay:hover{background:var(--mauve);color:white;}

.pop{position:fixed;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);font-size:4rem;pointer-events:none;z-index:9998;animation:popout 0.9s ease forwards;}
@keyframes popout{0%{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(0.3);}50%{opacity:1;transform:translate(-50%,-65%) scale(1.4);}100%{opacity:0;transform:translate(-50%,-90%) scale(1);}}

@media(max-width:500px){.things-masonry{columns:2;}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.sw{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none;}*{animation-duration:0.01ms!important;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<canvas id="confetti-canvas"></canvas>

<!-- COVER -->
<div id="cover">
  <div class="cover-bg-circle c1"></div>
  <div class="cover-bg-circle c2"></div>
  <div class="cover-thirty-bg">30</div>
  <div class="floating-el" style="top:8%;left:5%;font-size:2rem;animation-delay:0s;">🌸</div>
  <div class="floating-el" style="top:15%;right:8%;font-size:1.5rem;animation-delay:1s;">✨</div>
  <div class="floating-el" style="bottom:20%;left:10%;font-size:1.8rem;animation-delay:2s;">💛</div>
  <div class="floating-el" style="bottom:15%;right:6%;font-size:2rem;animation-delay:0.5s;">🌺</div>
  <div class="floating-el" style="top:40%;left:3%;font-size:1.2rem;animation-delay:3s;">💕</div>
  <div class="floating-el" style="top:35%;right:4%;font-size:1.4rem;animation-delay:1.5s;">🌼</div>
  <span class="cover-tag">a love letter for</span>
  <h1 class="cover-name">Marilyn<br/>Obeten</h1>
  <div class="cover-thirty-badge">30</div>
  <p class="cover-sub">thirty looks so good on you, my love 🌸</p>
  <button class="cover-btn" onclick="openGift()">🎉 Open your gift</button>
  <div class="scroll-nudge" id="scroll-nudge">
    <span class="arrow-bounce">↓</span>
    <span>keep scrolling</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- LETTER -->
<div class="sw" id="s-letter">
  <div class="sec-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">from me, to you</span>
    <h2 class="sec-title">A letter for <em>your thirty</em></h2>
    <div class="letter-wrap">
      <div class="letter-body">
        <p>Hi my love.</p>
        <p>I always say to people that "I am because she was." That is literally just me saying to people that I am who I am because of the leadership you gave me from a very young age. You have been there for me right from time. I can still remember all the sacrifices that you made for me, and the one that I will never ever forget is the fact that you paid for my makeup class that opened me to so many opportunities, opened me to the world. And I am so happy that I did not disappoint you.</p>
        <p>I want to thank you for being the blueprint for how my life has gone. Everything I have done is just so that I can make you proud, to be honest. Unconsciously, it has always been so that I can make you proud. Thank you for being the blueprint, setting the standard, being such a great sister, a great mentor, a great reference point.</p>
        <p>I am always so proud of being referred to as Marilyn's sister. Even though at some point I wanted to be called my own name, Giftie, I was just so happy to always be "oh, you're Marilyn's sister, oh you're Marilyn's sister." It was always a great thing to know.</p>
        <p>I want you to know that I am always proud of you. You have done so well for yourself. Even though you feel like oh, it's not going as planned, I need you to know that you have done so much for yourself and you should still be proud. People look up to you in ways and manners that you don't even know. I have been in rooms where I have heard the things that have been said about you, and when I hear them I am so proud. You might not know everything that they said about you, but I need you to know that people are proud of you. People are rooting for you always. People are shocked at how you do everything that you do with so much grace. It is just such an honour to be associated with you.</p>
        <p>I want you to know that the best part of my life was the times I spent with you when we were children, when we were teenagers, navigating adulthood. Oh, it was the best times. And I miss our midnight talks in the room. I miss all our laughter together. I miss all our fights. Oh my god, our fights were so hilarious. I miss them always. It really has been an amazing time growing up with you.</p>
        <p>And getting to thirty, I just hope that you never lose your inner child. You never lose your light. The light never dims for any reason. Remember that you are always loved, you are cherished, you are fiercely loved. I need you to remember that. I need you to know that I am always praying for you, always rooting for you. Even if you think you don't have anybody in this world, always know that you have a sister that will always be here for you.</p>
        <p>Happy 30th Marilyn. I love you so much.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="letter-sign">With all my love, Giftie 🌸</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- 30 THINGS -->
<div class="sw" id="s-things">
  <section id="things-sec">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">thirty reasons</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Things I love about <em>you</em></h2>
      <p class="things-intro">Just thirty of them. Could have written a hundred.</p>
      <div class="things-masonry" id="things-masonry"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- CHECKLIST -->
<div class="sw" id="s-check">
  <section id="check-sec">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">your 30s assignment</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">The checklist for <em>this decade</em></h2>
      <p class="check-intro">You have spent so long pouring into everyone else. These are your orders for the next ten years. Come back here anytime you tick one off, this page will remember every single one. I'll be watching 👀💛</p>
      <div class="prog-bg"><div class="prog-fill" id="prog-fill"></div></div>
      <p class="prog-label" id="prog-label">0 of 15 done</p>
      <div class="check-list" id="check-list"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- RATE HER -->
<div class="sw" id="s-rate">
  <section id="rate-sec">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">the official verdict</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">Rating Marilyn — <em>objectively</em></h2>
      <p class="rate-intro">We asked the experts (just me). Here are the results. Please note these scores are final and cannot be disputed. 😂</p>
      <div class="rate-list" id="rate-list"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- PRAYER -->
<div class="sw" id="s-prayer">
  <section id="prayer-sec">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">spoken over you</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">A prayer for <em>your thirties</em></h2>
      <div class="prayer-body">
        <p>"Dear Marilyn,</p>
        <p>This is my honest, most sincere prayer for you.</p>
        <p>I pray that in this new year, God surrounds you with His love. That He helps you wear down your defenses so you can see Him for who He really is, not as you have constructed in your heart and mind.</p>
        <p>I pray for the humility of heart to push you to say, "Lord, show me you and show me, me."</p>
        <p>I pray that God invades your life, that you will allow the Lord heal you. You have become so comfortable with the things that have hurt you, tried to break you, that it has become your protective armor against this world. Will you give it to the Lord?</p>
        <p>You were never meant to defend yourself. You are God's child. He is the one that has stewardship over your life. You do such a poor job of trying to protect yourself. That is why you keep getting hurt. Same script, different cast.</p>
        <p>So today, I pray that you hand over the pain, the hurt, the protective armor that you have used to try and keep hurt out, but in turn have also kept joy away.</p>
        <p>And I pray that in exchange, He gives you peace, He gives you joy, and a right standing. And just like God did for the prodigal son, I pray He throws you a party, so you know what a joy and a privilege it is to be called a daughter of the living God."</p>
      </div>
      <p class="prayer-amen">Amen. 🙏</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- SPOTIFY -->
<div class="sw" id="s-spotify">
  <section id="spotify-sec">
    <div style="max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;">
      <span class="eyebrow">made with love</span>
      <h2 class="sec-title">A playlist <em>just for you</em></h2>
      <div class="spotify-card">
        <span class="spotify-pulse">🎧</span>
        <div class="spotify-name">Marilyn's 30th Playlist</div>
        <div class="spotify-sub">every song chosen with you in mind</div>
        <a class="spotify-btn"
